 greater control and flexibility in managing your CRM.</span></span></p></span></div>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000003172-email-services-configuration-reply-forward-settings", "title": "Email Services Configuration - Reply &amp; Forward Settings", "folder": "LeadConnector Email", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155031378307/original/sTiyHi3hqgNimmaOnIK2tUuzV8jltXg4GQ1e0a.jpg?1724182488", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054231316/original/23bRFScnTg9oYPpDXx4OZXozxvTAJpNRQwc3b0.png?1758470530", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054231321/original/BvdCKIhgF7Vy47nQzfUR3HN0IfzE7bs1zw11a8.png?1758470589", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155031378366/original/qADgEHJ_7tnNV3n3amaaOlUmjr9frQvMeQ7243.jpg?1724182590", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054231333/original/jdRyIz7aCww5mpW8UvO75B0tc1t2wEuUyg6a79.png?1758470630", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054231336/original/n4KlwMHQhT3Jt1DRv06uvn11Klws22jyKQb67f.png?1758470671", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48286916898/original/w-1dICJ2Bsh_RZAP7ac2r7jnJsfEuOMb8Q61f8.png?1678723680", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155031378496/original/gePZQCEUWIstIyH1C68WKaiSaOcgjonr8Q9cc0.jpg?1724182805", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48260597029/original/MM1xCqK_FV3P9RIVLiwReIssTd-Qb4hbIQ0438.png?1667330277", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48260597698/original/IFF1KAgY2Qq0-jX_xY_cHqEWOSsOv33SJgbedc.png?1667330551", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155031548012/original/11wW6F1nZuJDiHlAkBvDF7D58hYMApIDLg6e20.png?1724401276"], "videos": ["https://www.loom.com/share/a590d5dd16b14278af6c6ea720950578"], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"#What-are-Reply-&amp;-Forwarding-Addresses?\">What are Reply &amp; Forwarding Addresses?</a><ul><li><a href=\"#Where-to-Find-Reply-&amp;-Forward-Settings\">Where to Find Reply &amp; Forward Settings</a></li><li><a href=\"#Forwarding-Address\">Forwarding Address</a></li><li><a href=\"#Reply-Address\">Reply Address</a></li><li><a href=\"#BCC-Emails\">BCC Emails</a></li><li><a href=\"#Forward-to-Assigned-User\">Forward to Assigned User</a></li><li><a href=\"#Enable-Reply-Tracking---Other-SMTP-Providers\">Enable Reply Tracking - Other SMTP Providers</a><ul><li><a href=\"#Example-With-Reply-Tracking\">Example With Reply Tracking</a></li><li><a href=\"#Example-Without-Reply-Tracking\">Example Without Reply Tracking</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#Frequently-Asked-Questions\">Frequently Asked Questions</a></li></ul></li></ul><hr><h1 class=\"tdfocus-1667329466353\" data-identifyelement=\"549\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"What-are-Reply-&amp;-Forwarding-Addresses?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"550\" dir=\"ltr\">What are Reply &amp; Forwarding Addresses?</strong></h1><p class=\"fd-toc tdfocus-1678723582677\" data-identifyelement=\"513\" dir=\"ltr\">Here are a few additional configurations that you can use to receive copies of the Emails that you get in your account using a Forwarding Address or BCC. Reply Tracking is also elaborated.</p><p class=\"fd-toc tdfocus-1678723582677\" data-identifyelement=\"513\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h2 class=\"fd-toc tdfocus-1678723582677\" data-identifyelement=\"513\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Where-to-Find-Reply-&amp;-Forward-Settings\"><strong>Where to Find Reply &amp; Forward Settings</strong></h2><p class=\"tdfocus-1667329471080\" data-identifyelement=\"553\" id=\"Once-you-are-in-the-location,-click-on&nbsp;Settings-->-Email-Services\">Once you are in the location, click on <strong class=\"tdfocus-1667329471993\" data-identifyelement=\"554\">Settings -&gt; Email Service</strong>s</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1667329468425\" data-identifyelement=\"555\"><br data-identifyelement=\"556\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"557\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"558\"><span data-identifyelement=\"559\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155031378307/original/sTiyHi3hqgNimmaOnIK2tUuzV8jltXg4GQ1e0a.jpg?1724182488\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155031378307\"></span></strong><br></p><hr><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1667329689888\" data-identifyelement=\"563\" id=\"Forwarding-Address\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Forwarding Address</strong></h2><p class=\"tdfocus-1667329674225\" data-identifyelement=\"567\" dir=\"ltr\">If a lead responds to an email, that response is always going to show up in <strong data-identifyelement=\"568\">Conversations</strong> tab, however, if you want a COPY of the lead\u2019s email response to go to someone\u2019 email, you could put in that email address there. <a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/support/solutions/articles/48001220605-what-is-lc-email-i-want-to-know-more#LC---Email-Pricing\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">All incoming and outgoing emails (To, CC, and BCC) will be charged.</a></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1667329674225\" data-identifyelement=\"567\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1667329674225\" data-identifyelement=\"567\" dir=\"ltr\">You could enter multiple forwarding email addresses here separated by a comma, e.g. <a class=\"tdfocus-1667329545376\" data-fr-linked=\"true\" data-identifyelement=\"578\" href=\"mailto:email1@test.com,\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">email1@test.com,</a> <a data-identifyelement=\"579\" href=\"http://email2@test.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" target=\"_blank\">email2@test.com</a>, <a class=\"tdfocus-1667329590304\" data-identifyelement=\"580\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"mailto:email3@test.com,\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">email3@test.com</a></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1667329480229\" data-identifyelement=\"572\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"574\"><br data-identifyelement=\"575\"></strong></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note tdfocus-1667329539639\" data-identifyelement=\"576\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong>IMPORTANT:</strong> Forwarding address and BCC Emails <strong>ONLY work when using Mailgun and LC Email.</strong> We don't support other smtp providers.</span><strong class=\"tdfocus-1667329479671\" data-identifyelement=\"583\" dir=\"ltr\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"mailto:kate@gohighlevel.com,\" data-identifyelement=\"584\"></a><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"mailto:kate@gohighlevel.com,\" data-identifyelement=\"585\"></a><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"mailto:kate@gohighlevel.com,\" data-identifyelement=\"586\"></a></strong></pre><p data-identifyelement=\"587\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1667329479671\" data-identifyelement=\"588\" dir=\"ltr\"><a data-fr-linked=\"true\" href=\"mailto:ebrahim@gohighlevel.com,\" data-identifyelement=\"589\"></a><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"mailto:kate@gohighlevel.com,\" data-identifyelement=\"590\"></a></strong></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1678723580355\" data-identifyelement=\"594\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 13px; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"595\"><br data-identifyelement=\"596\"></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"597\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054231316/original/23bRFScnTg9oYPpDXx4OZXozxvTAJpNRQwc3b0.png?1758470530\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155054231316\"></p><hr><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1678723458073\" data-identifyelement=\"597\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Reply-Address\"><strong>Reply Address</strong></h2><p class=\"tdfocus-1678723470377\" data-identifyelement=\"597\" dir=\"ltr\">Now we have the option to Add a reply-to address. All incoming emails will be sent to that email address instead of routing to the Conversation tab.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1667329695466\" data-identifyelement=\"602\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 13px; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"603\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1667329998793\" data-identifyelement=\"606\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">When you reply to the leads' email in your inbox outside the CRM, your reply will not sync back to the CRM.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1667329998793\" data-identifyelement=\"606\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; 