;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Correct setup and management are key to ensuring successful delivery. Beyond initial scheduling, there is flexibility to edit, reschedule, or cancel campaigns.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Key Management Features:</strong></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Reschedule</strong>: Change the time/date of a campaign up to one hour before launch.</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Edit Content</strong>: Update email content for scheduled, batch, or RSS campaigns before execution.</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Pause or Cancel</strong>: Stop a campaign before it sends (applies to Schedule, Batch, and RSS).</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Test Email/Preview</strong>: Send yourself a test before finalizing delivery.</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Frequently Asked Questions</strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q: Can I edit a campaign after scheduling it?</span></strong><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Yes, you can edit time/date up to one hour before sending. For Batch and RSS campaigns, you can also edit email content mid-schedule.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q: What happens if an RSS feed has no new content?</span></strong><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">No email will be sent until new content appears in the feed.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q: Which time zone is used for delivery?</span></strong><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">The system uses the location time zone set in your account.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q: Can I cancel a scheduled campaign?</span></strong><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Yes, you can pause or cancel scheduled, batch, and RSS campaigns before they send.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q: What\u2019s the difference between Schedule and Batch Schedule?</span></strong></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000002956-bot-detection-preventing-statistics-increment-and-automation-execution", "title": "Bot Detection Preventing Statistics Increment and Automation Execution", "folder": "LeadConnector Email", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155030290309/original/jgtdEcid_6IqJAl2S8umEQ3dY7olukdRDw826a.png?1722510448"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Overview</span></strong></h3><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">In the realm of email marketing, accurate metrics are crucial for understanding customer engagement and the effectiveness of your campaigns. Bots can artificially inflate your open and click rates, leading to misleading data. To combat this, we have introduced the Bot Detection Preventing Statistics Increment and Automation Execution feature.</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">What Does This Feature Do?</strong></span></h3><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">This feature identifies and mitigates the impact of bots interacting with your emails. When a bot is detected opening or clicking an email, the following actions are taken:</span></p><ol style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><li style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Preventing Statistics Increment</strong>: The email open or click counter will not increment, ensuring your engagement metrics reflect only genuine user interactions.</span></li><li style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Preventing Automation Execution</strong>: Any automation events triggered by email opens or clicks will not execute if a bot is detected, maintaining the integrity of your automated workflows.</span></li></ol><p><br></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">How to enable/disable the Bot Detection Prevention Settings?</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>By default, the Bot Detection Preventing Statistics Increment and Automation Execution feature is turned off.</strong></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1667329471080\" data-identifyelement=\"553\" dir=\"ltr\">Navigate to Settings -&gt; Business Profile. Under the \"General Section,\" you can find the settings Check/uncheck to enable and disable the settings</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1667329471080\" data-identifyelement=\"553\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155030290309/original/jgtdEcid_6IqJAl2S8umEQ3dY7olukdRDw826a.png?1722510448\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155030290309\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note tdfocus-1671142390343\" data-identifyelement=\"519\" dir=\"ltr\">ONLY applicable to LC Email System an Mailgun users.</pre><h3 style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></h3>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000001151-integrating-linkedin-lead-ads-with-crm", "title": "Initiate LinkedIn Integration:", "folder": "Linkedin Lead Ads Integration", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009528551/original/N97444O72nviaFSR4PTObBZAvNras6Do4Qcf19.png?1696714065", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009528552/original/I0BgY3ZQgjgsLDGA0jhVd0eNBN2avkC19g2ef6.png?1696714090", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009528586/original/RwsSsa6B9HJnIVwtCA06DN_U-6yPW5fn0A7b2e.png?1696714406", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009528604/original/24hzpn6Q_earFGhOEekRLapenHw6sUEVZQ391b.png?1696714538", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009528620/original/fIitKSnoiK-jQm_Y_DkLtJ6Es4ViKh37Nwde7f.png?1696714636", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009528628/original/jb44pupUkMKmGiKGuJj7U5IfJ0voNGVCDA3019.png?1696714711", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009528631/original/ETTW2n1cQ86AbeyvXFYN4ndZrfoiLGNFMg39d5.png?1696714729"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">Seamlessly fetch all your leads from LinkedIn directly into your CRM with our easy integration.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"fd-toc\"><br></p><p class=\"fd-toc\"><br><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"#%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8BHow-it-works?\">How it works?</a><ul><li><a href=\"#Initiate-LinkedIn-Integration%3A\">Initiate LinkedIn Integration:</a></li><li><a href=\"#Authorize-Account-&amp;-Permissions%3A\">Authorize Account &amp; Permissions:</a></li><li><a href=\"#Select-Ad-Accounts%3A\">Select Ad Accounts:</a></li><li><a href=\"#Ad-Account-Requirements%3A\">Ad Account Requirements:</a></li><li><a href=\"#Configure-Synchronization%3A\">Configure Synchronization:</a></li><li><a href=\"#Form-Field-Mapping%3A\">Form Field Mapping:</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#Frequently-Asked-Questions-(FAQs)%3A\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs):</a><ul><ul><li><a href=\"#How-do-I-add/update-ad-accounts-in-the-future?\">How do I add/update ad accounts in the future?</a></li><li><a href=\"#I-can't-see-all-forms-under-the-LinkedIn-field-form-mapping.-What-should-I-do?\">I can't see all forms under the LinkedIn field form mapping. What should I do?</a></li><li><a href=\"#Can-I-alter-the-sync-time-for-an-ad-account-after-integration?\">Can I alter the sync time for an ad account after integration?</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-can-I-disconnect-the-integration?\">How can I disconnect the integration?</a></li><li><a href=\"#Is-it-possible-to-link-the-same-ad-account-across-multiple-sub-accounts?\">Is it possible to link the same ad account across multiple sub-accounts?</a></li></ul></ul></li></ul><h1 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"\u200b\u200bHow-it-works?\"><br>How it works?</h1><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Initiate-LinkedIn-Integration:\">Initiate LinkedIn Integration:</h2><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">Navigate to the sub-account labs to enable LinkedIn integration.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Go to the integrations page located under the settings tab.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Find the LinkedIn integration.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Click on Connect to initiate the process.</li></ul><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Authorize-Account-&amp;-Permissions:\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009528551/original/N97444O72nviaFSR4PTObBZAvNras6Do4Qcf19.png?1696714065\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155009528551\"></h2><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Authorize-Account-&amp;-Permissions:\">Authorize Account &amp; Permissions:</h2><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">Log in to your LinkedIn account.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Ensure you grant all necessary permissions for the integration to be successful.</li></ul><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Select-Ad-Accounts:\">Select Ad Accounts:</h2><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">Choose an ad account or multiple ad accounts to connect to your sub-account.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Note: There's no limit to the number of ad accounts you can connect to your sub-account.</li></ul><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009528552/original/I0BgY3ZQgjgsLDGA0jhVd0eNBN2avkC19g2ef6.png?1696714090\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155009528552\"></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Ad-Account-Requirements:\">Ad Account Requirements:</h2><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">Ensure the ad account you're integrating has a linked LinkedIn page. Without this, the integration won't be successful.</li></ul><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Configure-Synchronization:\">Configure Synchronization:</h2><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">For each ad account you're integrating, determine its sync time.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Options include:<ul><li dir=\"ltr\">All leads: Sync all leads from the past 90 days and all new leads.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">New leads: Only sync new leads.</li></ul></li><li dir=\"ltr\">Click on Connect to proceed.</li></ul><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Form-Field-Mapping:\">Form Field Mapping:</h2><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">Click on Configure form field mapping or go to the LinkedIn form field mapping tab at the top.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Use the Map Fields button to align your LinkedIn form fields with CRM fields.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Click Confirm to save and complete the integration.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">If you want to disable inbound leads from any of the forms, toggle the status off.</li></ul><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009528586/original/RwsSsa6B9HJnIVwtCA06DN_U-6yPW5fn0A7b2e.png?1696714406\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155009528586\"></p><p class=\"fd-toc\"><br></p><h1 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Frequently-Asked-Questions-(FAQs):\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs):</h1><ul><li><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-do-I-add/update-ad-accounts-in-the-future?\">How do I add/update ad accounts in the future?</h3></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">Navigate to Manage Ad Accounts under Integrations &gt; LinkedIn. From here, you can add/remove or modify the sync time for existing ad accounts. Click Update to save changes.</p><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009528604/original/24hzpn6Q_earFGhOEekRLapenHw6sUEVZQ391b.png?1696714538\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155009528604\"></p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><h3 dir=\"ltr\">I can't see all forms under the LinkedIn field form mapping. What should I do?</h3>For efficiency, only mapped forms are displayed upon revisiting the 'LinkedIn form field mapping' page. To view all, including unmapped forms, click Refresh on the page's top right.</li></ul><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009528620/original/fIitKSnoiK-jQm_Y_DkLtJ6Es4ViKh37Nwde7f.png?1696714636\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155009528620\"><br></p><ul><li><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Can-I-alter-the-sync-time-for-an-ad-account-after-integration?\">Can I alter the sync time for an ad account after integration?</h3></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">Absolutely! Visit Manage Ad Accounts to adjust the sync time for any connected ad account. Changing from 'New leads' to 'All leads' will fetch the last 90 days of leads into the CRM for that account, provided the form fields are correctly mapped.<br><br></p><ul><li><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-can-I-disconnect-the-integration?\">How can I disconnect the integration?</h3></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Go to the integrations page, select Disconnect, and then confirm by clicking Disconnect in the pop-up.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009528628/original/jb44pupUkMKmGiKGuJj7U5IfJ0voNGVCDA3019.png?1696714711\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155009528628\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155009528631/original/ETTW2n1cQ86AbeyvXFYN4ndZrfoiLGNFMg39d5.png?1696714729\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155009528631\"></p><ul><li><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Is-it-possible-to-link-the-same-ad-account-across-multiple-sub-accounts?\">Is it possible to link the same ad account across multiple sub-accounts?</h3></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">Yes, an ad account can be connected to multiple sub-accounts. All leads from that ad account will populate in every linked sub-account.</p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000001733-managing-payments-quick-start-guide", "title": "Managing Payments Quick Start Guide", "folder": "Quick Start Guides", "images": [], "videos": ["https://www.youtube.com/embed/s2l9WCwn82g?&amp;wmode=opaque"], "content": "\n\t\t<p><span class=\"fr-video fr-deletable fr-fvc fr-dvb fr-draggable\"><iframe width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/s2l9WCwn82g?&amp;wmode=opaque\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\"></iframe></span><br></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000007200-workflow-actions-generate-marketing-audit-report", "title": "Workflow Actions: Generate Marketing Audit Report", "folder": "Prospecting Tool", "images": [], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"#Overview\">Overview</a></li><li><a href=\"#Action-Name\">Action Name</a></li><li><a href=\"#Action-Description\">Action Description</a></li><li><a href=\"#Action-Details\">Action Details</a></li><li><a href=\"#Example\">Example</a></li></ul><hr><h1 data-end=\"103\" data-start=\"89\"><strong data-end=\"103\" data-start=\"91\">Overview</strong></h1><p data-end=\"445\" data-start=\"105\">The <strong data-end=\"146\" data-start=\"109\">Marketing Audit Report Generation</strong> workflow action allows you to automatically create a <strong data-end=\"226\" data-start=\"200\">Marketing Audit Report</strong> for every new lead (contact) added to your sub-account. With workflow automation, you can instantly enrich new contacts, understand their online presence, and personalize follow-up outreach \u2014 all without manual effort.</p><p data-end=\"545\" data-start=\"447\">To use this action, ensure the <strong data-end=\"544\" data-start=\"478\">Prospecting Tool is enabled and subscribed on your sub-account</strong>.</p><blockquote data-end=\"842\" data-start=\"547\"><p data-end=\"842\" data-start=\"549\"><strong data-end=\"558\" data-start=\"549\">Note:</strong> Previously, marketing audits could only be generated for leads created <em data-end=\"638\" data-start=\"630\">inside</em> the Prospecting Tool. With this new workflow action, you can now generate audits for <strong data-end=\"755\" data-start=\"724\">any contact from any source</strong> \u2014 Facebook Ads, funnels, forms, imports, integrations, webinars, or any other channel.</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"847\"><h1 data-end=\"866\" data-start=\"849\"><strong data-end=\"866\" data-start=\"851\">Action Name</strong></h1><p data-end=\"903\" data-start=\"868\"><strong data-end=\"903\" data-start=\"868\">Generate Marketing Audit Report</strong></p><hr data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"908\"><h1 data-end=\"934\" data-start=\"910\"><strong data-end=\"934\" data-start=\"912\">Action Description</strong></h1><p data-end=\"1081\" data-start=\"936\">This workflow action automatically generates a <strong data-end=\"1009\" data-start=\"983\">Marketing Audit Report</strong> for a contact by using the details available in their profile, such as:</p><ul data-end=\"1178\" data-start=\"1083\"><li data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1083\"><p data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1085\"><strong data-end=\"1102\" data-start=\"1085\">Business Name</strong></p></li><li data-end=\"1124\" data-start=\"1105\"><p data-end=\"1124\" data-start=\"1107\"><strong data-end=\"1122\" data-start=\"1107\">Website URL</strong></p></li><li data-end=\"1140\" data-start=\"1125\"><p data-end=\"1140\" data-start=\"1127\"><strong data-end=\"1138\" data-start=\"1127\">Address</strong></p></li><li data-end=\"1157\" data-start=\"1141\"><p data-end=\"1157\" data-start=\"1143\"><strong data-end=\"1155\" data-start=\"1143\" dir=\"ltr\">Email</strong></p></li><li data-end=\"1178\" data-start=\"1158\"><p data-end=\"1178\" data-start=\"1160\"><strong data-end=\"1176\" data-start=\"1160\">Phone Number</strong></p></li></ul><p data-end=\"1277\" data-start=\"1180\">The more complete the contact\u2019s information is, the more accurate and detailed the audit will be.</p><hr data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1282\"><h1 data-end=\"1304\" data-start=\"1284\"><strong data-end=\"1304\" data-start=\"1286\">Action Details</strong></h1><h3 data-end=\"1327\" data-start=\"1306\"><strong data-end=\"1327\" data-start=\"1310\">Prerequisites</strong></h3><ol data-end=\"1598\" data-start=\"1328\"><li data-end=\"1408\" data-start=\"1328\"><p data-end=\"1408\" data-start=\"1331\">Your <strong data-end=\"1351\" data-start=\"1336\">sub-account</strong> must have an active <strong data-end=\"1405\" data-start=\"1372\">Prospecting Tool subscription</strong>.</p></li><li data-end=\"1478\" data-start=\"1409\"><p data-end=\"1478\" data-start=\"1412\">Ensure that the <strong data-end=\"1448\" data-start=\"1428\">Prospecting Tool</strong> is enabled in your account.</p></li><li data-end=\"1598\" data-start=\"1479\"><p data-end=\"1598\" data-start=\"1482\">Add the action into a workflow that triggers when a contact is available (recommended trigger: <strong data-end=\"1596\" data-start=\"1577\">Contact Created</strong>).</p></li></ol><hr data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1603\"><h3 data-end=\"1625\" data-start=\"1605\"><strong data-end=\"1625\" data-start=\"1609\">How It Works</strong></h3><ol data-end=\"1905\" data-start=\"1626\"><li data-end=\"1662\" data-start=\"1626\"><p data-end=\"1662\" data-start=\"1629\">A contact enters your workflow.</p></li><li data-end=\"1734\" data-start=\"1663\"><p data-end=\"1734\" data-start=\"1666\">The <strong data-end=\"1705\" data-start=\"1670\">Generate Marketing Audit Report</strong> action runs automatically.</p></li><li data-end=\"1819\" data-start=\"1735\"><p data-end=\"1819\" data-start=\"1738\" dir=\"ltr\">Prospecting Tool uses the contact\u2019s available business information such as business name, website, email etc to recoganize the right business entity and then run detailed audit for it</p></li><li data-end=\"1905\" data-start=\"1820\"><p data-end=\"1905\" data-start=\"1823\">The generated report is attached to that prospect inside the <strong data-end=\"1904\" data-start=\"1884\">Prospecting Tool</strong>.</p></li></ol><hr data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1910\"><h3 data-end=\"1959\" data-start=\"1912\"><strong data-end=\"1957\" data-start=\"1916\">Duplicate Prevention (Important Note)</strong></h3><p data-end=\"2054\" data-start=\"1960\" dir=\"ltr\">For contacts <strong data-end=\"2019\" data-start=\"1973\">originally created by the Prospecting Tool</strong>, we automatically prevents:</p><ul data-end=\"2136\" data-start=\"2056\"><li data-end=\"2093\" data-start=\"2056\"><p data-end=\"2093\" data-start=\"2058\">Duplicate marketing audit reports</p></li><li data-end=\"2136\" data-start=\"2094\"><p data-end=\"2136\" data-start=\"2096\">Re-triggering the same audit workflows</p></li></ul><p data-end=\"2252\" data-start=\"2138\">This ensures clean data and avoids unnecessary audit generation for leads already handled by the Prospecting Tool.</p><hr data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2257\"><h3 data-end=\"2300\" data-start=\"2259\"><strong data-end=\"2300\" data-start=\"2263\">Where to Find the Generated Audit</strong></h3><p data-end=\"2324\" data-start=\"2301\">Once the workflow runs:</p><ol data-end=\"2539\" data-start=\"2326\"><li data-end=\"2376\" data-start=\"2326\"><p data-end=\"2376\" data-start=\"2329\">Navigate to <strong data-end=\"2373\" data-start=\"2341\">Marketing \u2192 Prospecting Tool</strong>.</p></li><li data-end=\"2409\" data-start=\"2377\"><p data-end=\"2409\" data-start=\"2380\">Open the <strong data-end=\"2402\" data-start=\"2389\">Marketing</strong> tab.</p></li><li data-end=\"2460\" data-start=\"2410\"><p data-end=\"2460\" data-start=\"2413\">Search for the specific <strong data-end=\"2457\" data-start=\"2437\">prospect/contact</strong>.</p></li><li data-end=\"2539\" data-start=\"2461\"><p data-end=\"2539\" data-start=\"2464\">You\u2019ll see the newly generated <strong data-end=\"2521\" data-start=\"2495\">Marketing Audit Report</strong> for that contact.</p></li></ol><hr data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2544\"><h1 data-end=\"2559\" data-start=\"2546\"><strong data-end=\"2559\" data-start=\"2548\">Example</strong></h1><h3 data-end=\"2613\" data-start=\"2561\"><strong data-end=\"2613\" data-start=\"2565\">Use Case: Audit Every New Lead Automatically</strong></h3><p data-end=\"2734\" data-start=\"2614\">You want to audit all new contacts coming in \u2014 from Facebook Ads, funnels, events, referrals, imports, or anywhere else.</p><ol data-end=\"2875\" data-start=\"2736\"><li data-end=\"2793\" data-start=\"2736\"><p data-end=\"2793\" data-start=\"2739\">Create a workflow with <strong data-end=\"2790\" data-start=\"2762\">Trigger: Contact Created</strong>.</p></li><li data-end=\"2850\" data-start=\"2794\"><p data-end=\"2850\" data-start=\"2797\">Add the <strong data-end=\"2840\" data-start=\"2805\">Generate Marketing Audit Report</strong> action.</p></li><li data-end=\"2875\" data-start=\"2851\"><p data-end=\"2875\" data-start=\"2854\">Publish the workflow.</p></li></ol><p data-end=\"2937\" data-start=\"2877\">Now, every new contact added to your CRM will automatically:</p><ul data-end=\"3075\" data-start=\"2939\"><li data-end=\"2977\" data-start=\"2939\"><p data-end=\"2977\" data-start=\"2941\">Have its business details analyzed</p></li><li data-end=\"3021\" data-start=\"2978\"><p data-end=\"3021\" data-start=\"2980\">Receive a custom Marketing Audit Report</p></li><li data-end=\"3075\" data-start=\"3022\"><p data-end=\"3075\" data-start=\"3024\">Appear inside the <strong data-end=\"3062\" data-start=\"3042\">Prospecting Tool</strong> for review</p></li></ul><p data-end=\"3188\" data-start=\"3077\" dir=\"ltr\">This gives your team immediate insights and helps tailor outreach to each lead\u2019s current marketing performance.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"468\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"-1\"><br dir=\"ltr\"></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000000090-how-to-set-up-workflow-goal-events", "title": "How to set up Workflow Goal Events", "folder": "Workflow", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155000617849/original/Bk6vPFLzLVPdSIO57APfW-ekrtxgHpR-Pw925f.gif?1686138124", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155000504595/original/VlDIO-g_X-ntiIZJKWkQCzGLBjIpN2YzfQ0efb.png?1686039268", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155000617892/original/KHLM_BOkYEMtuk1PaNhw23uuZJZEBDmvKwdd4e.png?1686138149", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155000617981/original/kpPIV3ryxf4-F3YBRJonnKJX9Oa0-55qqQ79a9.gif?1686138197", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155000618040/original/nM9BaE78J9oHahNEhB82wj3v10bKARZv2g1b26.gif?1686138227", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155000618117/original/OsdRwJ0gLdMJWnBSOHg1i7UlsnmtTJEX1g1302.gif?1686138277", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155000618142/original/RiOgby_RfH9T4-uEqZiIPB7hgr_9PNU48A4248.gif?1686138299", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155000618187/original/CXoPkdl1U98_nq_t5p8rYrHulxIFln-Kvw7e1f.gif?1686138351"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p data-identifyelement=\"518\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Have you ever thought about how great it would be if contacts who meet a specific condition or a goal event within a workflow could automatically move to a specific step within a workflow without going through the previous steps?&nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"519\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"520\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"521\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Well, now you can help with the Workflow Goal Events Action. This article will cover Goal Events and how and when to use them.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"502\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"503\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"504\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"505\">Please Note:&nbsp;</strong></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note tdfocus-1686039218278\" data-identifyelement=\"506\" dir=\"ltr\">For version 1, we restricted Goal Event filters to <u class=\"tdfocus-1686039229839\" data-identifyelement=\"507\" dir=\"ltr\">email events</u>, <u data-identifyelement=\"507\" dir=\"ltr\">addin</u><u data-identifyelement=\"522\">g or r</u><u data-identifyelement=\"507\" dir=\"ltr\">emoving tags</u>,&nbsp;<u class=\"tdfocus-1686039227039\" data-identifyelement=\"508\" dir=\"ltr\">trigger link clicks</u> and <u>appointment status</u> only. We plan to add more goals events in the future, such as forms submissions, etc.<br data-identifyelement=\"509\"><br data-identifyelement=\"510\">Also currently we are restricting to <strong data-identifyelement=\"511\"><u data-identifyelement=\"555\">ONE</u></strong><u data-identifyelement=\"556\">&nbsp;Goal Event</u> per workflow.</pre><p data-identifyelement=\"512\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overf