 176);\">1. Received an Email Event:</span></a></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Usage-Cases%3A\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Usage Cases:</span></a></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1686039391560\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#FAQs%3A\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">FAQs:</span></a></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-left: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#2.-Clicked-a-Trigger-Link%3A\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">2. Clicked a Trigger Link:</span></a></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Usage-Cases%3A-1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Usage Cases:</span></a></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#FAQs%3A-2\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">FAQs:</span></a></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1686039468010\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-left: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#3.-Contact-Tags-(Add-&amp;-Remove)%3A\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">3. Contact Tags (Add &amp; Remove):</span></a></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Usage-Cases%3A-3\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Usage Cases:</span></a></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#FAQs%3A-4\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">FAQs:</span></a></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1686039452912\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-left: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#4.-Appointment-Status%3A\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">4. Appointment Status:</span><